        "  validate       Compare the last snapshot against files that changed since\n",
        "  history        Show past snapshots and validation results\n",
        "  predict        Predict which files are most likely to break next\n",
        "  accuracy       Show prediction accuracy, per-signal breakdown, learned weights\n",
        "  effectiveness  Measure whether the risk reflex improves over time\n",
        "  meter          Show the prediction-meter pair count (snapshot/validation progress)\n",
        "  emerging       Show anticipatory (emerging-risk) signals for trending files\n",
        "\n",
        "Flags:\n",
        "  --all          For /risk and /risk snapshot|validate: include all scored files\n",
    );
    print!("{usage}");
}
```

